{"id":"bw-a4w.4","title":"Verify bd create supports --estimated-minutes flag","description":"Check if bd create --estimated-minutes=N populates the estimated_minutes column. If not, find workaround (bd update post-create, or direct DB write). This is a blocker for planner integration.","status":"closed","priority":0,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-03-16T16:58:13Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-16T16:59:09Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T16:59:09Z","close_reason":"Confirmed: bd create --estimate=N (or -e N) populates estimated_minutes column. Flag exists and works.","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-a4w.4","depends_on_id":"bw-a4w","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-03-16T16:58:13Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":2,"comment_count":0}
