{"id":"bw-a4w.8","title":"Historical calibration engine","description":"Phase 3: Create calibration.ts. Compare estimated vs actual minutes for closed beads. Compute per-bucket (issue_type x priority) calibration factors. Needs 10+ samples per bucket. Store factors in project config. API endpoint for recalculation.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-03-16T16:58:15Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-16T17:08:19Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T17:08:19Z","close_reason":"calibration.ts with computeCalibration, applyCalibratedEstimate, hasCalibrationData. Per-bucket factors with 5-sample min threshold.","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-a4w.8","depends_on_id":"bw-a4w","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-03-16T16:58:15Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"bw-a4w.8","depends_on_id":"bw-a4w.6","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-03-16T16:58:25Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
