{"id":"bw-3zk","title":"Add kit management agent launch from beads-web","description":"After submission, trigger kit analysis agent from the fleet board. Button on Submitted cards launches the kit-analyzer agent from .claude/agents/kit-analyzer.md. Agent runs post-ship analysis: assess app for common patterns, extract to CycleKit or propose new kits.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-16T00:40:54Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-02-16T11:49:02Z","closed_at":"2026-02-16T11:49:02Z","close_reason":"Kit management agent launch implemented via fleet action API using kit-analyzer agent","labels":["agent-launch","pipeline"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-27s","title":"Fleet page: add watch directory for auto-discovery of new app repos","description":"The beads-web config at ~/.beads-web.json has no watchDirs configured. Add /Users/janemckay/dev/claude_projects as a watch directory so new app repos (created by the factory development workflow) are automatically registered. This avoids the manual curl POST step. The watch directory feature already exists in the codebase - just needs to be configured.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-16T00:18:36Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:58:59Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T09:58:59Z","close_reason":"watchDirs already configured in ~/.beads-web.json with /Users/janemckay/dev/claude_projects — auto-discovery is active","dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-1o9","title":"Fleet card: show research report preview snippet on hover or inline","description":"Currently the research report only shows when you navigate into the issue detail page. Add a brief preview (first 2-3 sentences of the Executive Summary) to the fleet card itself so Jane can see key findings at a glance without clicking through. Could be a hover tooltip, an expandable section on the card, or a small preview below the card title.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-16T00:18:23Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:58:50Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T09:58:50Z","close_reason":"Research report snippet extracted from Executive Summary, displayed on fleet cards with line-clamp-3","dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-yq1","title":"Factory: Add App Store submission tracking","description":"Track App Store submission status for completed apps. Fields: submission date, review status, approval date, rejection reasons. Could be a new issue type or label-based workflow.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-15T00:38:14Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-02-15T19:42:40Z","closed_at":"2026-02-15T19:42:40Z","close_reason":"Implemented: notes display, epic progress bars, submission tracking with colored badges and Submissions built-in view","labels":["factory-integration"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-nbv","title":"Factory: Add progress percentage bars","description":"Show progress percentage for epics and multi-step workflows. Calculate from child task completion ratios. Display as progress bars on dashboard and kanban cards.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-15T00:38:10Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-02-15T19:42:40Z","closed_at":"2026-02-15T19:42:40Z","close_reason":"Implemented: notes display, epic progress bars, submission tracking with colored badges and Submissions built-in view","labels":["factory-integration"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-0i9.7","title":"Fix keepPreviousData showing stale plan/research when navigating between issues","description":"Both usePlanReport and useResearchReport use keepPreviousData. When navigating from an issue with a plan to one without, the old plan content briefly shows on the wrong issue. Consider showing a loading skeleton instead of stale content, or clearing data on key change.","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:13Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-08T12:18:17Z","closed_at":"2026-03-08T12:18:17Z","close_reason":"Removed keepPreviousData from plan and research hooks to prevent stale content flash","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-0i9.7","depends_on_id":"bw-0i9","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:13Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-0i9.6","title":"Extract shared MarkdownRenderer component from duplicated prose styling","description":"The plan and research report sections in src/app/issue/[id]/page.tsx have ~14 lines of duplicated Tailwind prose classes. Extract a shared MarkdownRenderer component that accepts a variant or accentColor prop to set the blockquote border color.","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:11Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","closed_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","close_reason":"Extracted MarkdownRenderer component with accentColor prop","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-0i9.6","depends_on_id":"bw-0i9","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:11Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-0i9.5","title":"Await params in API routes for Next.js 15 compatibility","description":"Plan route (src/app/api/plan/[issueId]/route.ts) and research route (src/app/api/research/[appName]/route.ts) both destructure params synchronously. Next.js 15 makes params a Promise, so this will break on upgrade. Change to: const { issueId } = await params;","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:09Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","closed_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","close_reason":"All API routes now await params for Next.js 15 compat","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-0i9.5","depends_on_id":"bw-0i9","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:09Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-0i9.4","title":"Fix 404 returning fake success data in plan and research hooks","description":"Both usePlanReport and useResearchReport return { content: '', repoPath: '' } on 404 instead of throwing. This conflates 'no plan exists' with 'plan is empty'. Should throw on 404 and use TanStack Query error state to distinguish, or return null with updated types.","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:05Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","closed_at":"2026-03-08T12:17:14Z","close_reason":"Hooks return null on 404 instead of fake empty data","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-0i9.4","depends_on_id":"bw-0i9","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-17T20:49:05Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-91h","title":"Display story points in issue table and detail page","description":"Once story_points flows into the web data model, display it in the IssueTable component (new column or inline) and on the issue detail page. Follow the pattern of estimated_minutes display.","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-10T17:55:38Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-24T09:59:52Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T09:59:52Z","close_reason":"Story points displayed in IssueTable (sortable SP column), IssueCard row, and issue detail sidebar","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-91h","depends_on_id":"bw-5g0","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-02-10T17:55:47Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"bw-rx3","title":"Add tokens-per-story-point efficiency panel","description":"Once both token tracking (bw-co0) and story points (bw-6gw) are complete, build the efficiency metrics panel: tokens_per_story_point, cost_per_story_point, scatter chart of tokens vs story points across issues. This task depends on both epics being complete.","status":"closed","priority":4,"issue_type":"task","owner":"janemckay@me.com","created_at":"2026-02-10T16:19:01Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","updated_at":"2026-03-24T10:01:28Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T10:01:28Z","close_reason":"EfficiencyPanel with avg tokens/SP, cost/SP, bar chart. Added to dashboard between TokenUsageSummary and WhatsNext.","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bw-rx3","depends_on_id":"bw-6gw","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-02-10T16:20:34Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"bw-rx3","depends_on_id":"bw-fom","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-02-10T16:20:34Z","created_by":"Jane McKay","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":2,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
